<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all four credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all four credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned paper in all four credit auctions, injecting 4.904 billion pesos in the secondary market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     MAXIMUM MINIMUM AVERAGE BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>    1.301 bln  15 days  25.70   25.58   25.63   8    2</p>
<p>    1.301 bln  14 days  25.61   25.58   25.60   3    3</p>
<p>    1.302 bln   9 days  25.56   25.08   25.15   2    2</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   1 day   24.82   24.78   24.80   2    2</p>
<p>NOTE: Maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>--Patricia Lezama, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559</p>
</text>
